<title>USA: Dairy Mart Q2 revenues up 3.5 pct.</title>
<headline>Dairy Mart Q2 revenues up 3.5 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ENFIELD, Conn. 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997		     1996</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.48		    $0.38</p>
<p> Net		 2,234		    2,237</p>
<p> Revs		156,132		  150,818</p>
<p>	  6  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr		 $0.39		    $0.33</p>
<p> Net		 1.84		     1.90</p>
<p> Revs		297.5		    284.3</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) NOTE: The company said net income on a per-share basis increased to $0.48 from $0.38 primarily because of a 20 percent decrease in the weighted average number of shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Dairy Mart also said its annual meeting would be held on October 30.</p>
</text>
